        "turn_total": 34730.8
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "caller",
      "text": "I also already get cover through my employer, so what's the point?",
      "at": "2026-10-02T06:33:51.182272+00:00",
      "tool_calls": [],
      "timings_ms": {}
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "The catch is employer cover usually has a smaller sum insured and ends the day you leave the job. Your own policy stays with you no matter where you work.\n\nDoes your employer cover just you, or your family too?",
